# Uploads

::summary
The Files hub destination in the shell wrapper: Upload title-row action, the F-11 Photos / Videos / Audio / Other segmented-control, the Photos Gallery grid (Gallery covers the REFUTED media-grid), and the row idiom for the other segments. The file-preview and photo-detail sheets live in `modals/` — no inline copies.
::

