::

Upload is the page-specific control (up-arrow icon, not a plus), icon-only in the title row (G3 pass, WP-N3 08-11) with the old label as `aria-label`; drag-drop onto the list is also accepted. The category switcher is the `segmented-control` block. Photos is an adaptive square grid (`/api/images?source=upload`) expressed with the `gallery` block — `media-grid` was REFUTED in the coverage matrix, Gallery covers it — whose tiles open the photo detail sheet; the other segments keep the row + preview-sheet idiom.

## Sheets — defined once, opened from here

- **File preview** — `modals/file-preview.surf` (`name=file-preview`), via any non-photo row (`openFilePreview`): preview hero, Kind/Size/Uploaded meta, Download · Copy link · Send in message · Move to trash (danger last).
- **Photo detail** — `modals/photo-detail.surf` (`name=photo-detail`), via a Gallery tile (`openPhotoDetail`): full-width hero, Uploaded, Description, AI description, Tags chips.
